{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32283","headline":"经故翰林袁学士居 · 温庭筠","name":"经故翰林袁学士居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劒逐惊波玉委尘，谢安门下更何人。\n西州城外花千树，尽是羊昙醉後春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32283.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32283","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗镜》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩鏡_(四庫全書本)）"}